{"abstract":"Status Quo for elearning at the Danish university colleges (UC) has been investigated. The colleges have 12 years of experience, and during this period of time, knowledge about how to establish and deliver elearning that aims at including and unifying students in a collaborative learning endeavour has grown, not only at the European level but also in the entire world. In a Computer Supported Collaborative Learning (CSCL) approach focus is on the establishment of learning processes, digital education, collaboration, dialogue, critical reflection and the establishment of Communities of Practice (CoPs).This paper aims to assess how and to what extent knowledge about CSCL permeates and qualifies the way the elearning practices in the UCs. The article suggests that the challenge to promote and qualify the use of elearning at University Colleges may be an organizational one.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Risager, Lis Lak","Luth-Hanssen, Vidar","Rask, Anders Bindslev","Sorensen, Elsebeth K."],"cuid":["S02-100.00-038949"],"event":{"end":"2015-11-20","place":"Aalborg, dk","start":"2015-11-17","title":"1th D4Learning International Conference:Innovation in Digital Learning for Inclusion (D4L)","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["E learning","E læring","IKT","Innovative teaching"],"level":"sci","oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-UCN"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-UCN"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"inclusive e learning practices at university colleges in denmark","src":["kp","ucn"],"src-code":["DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-UCN"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://vbn.aau.dk/files/222220391/D4Learning_Proceedings_2015_OA_e_BOOK_Version.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-038949","ids":["kp-66a89109-00d6-44a5-bc27-b44e46b10ed2","ucn-66a89109-00d6-44a5-bc27-b44e46b10ed2"],"keyword":["IKT","e-learning","e-læring","innovative teaching"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","noi":["Local-1-2-9775B2E5A0E52E927EEB383FA47057CA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://vbn.aau.dk/files/222220391/D4Learning_Proceedings_2015_OA_e_BOOK_Version.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"kp university college copenhagen","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-KP","l3nl":"KP","l3nn":"KP University College Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KP University College Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Professionshøjskole, Institut for Ernæring og Jordemoderkundskab, Professionsbachelor i Ernæring og Sundhed (ikke synk)"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-KP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ucn university college of northern denmark","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCN","l3nl":"University College of Northern Denmark","l3nn":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","namevar":["Professionshøjskolen UCN, UCN Direktion, UCN Erhverv, Energi- og Automationsuddannelserne"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-UCN","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lis Lak","key":"risagerpau","last":"Risager","locid":"500c2707-2248-4ca6-9c30-0c1e554ea8ac","name":"Risager, Lis Lak","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Vidar","key":"luthhanssenpau","last":"Luth-Hanssen","name":"Luth-Hanssen, Vidar","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders Bindslev","key":"raskpau","last":"Rask","locid":"9cc3e7e7-b4b5-432a-b23b-29c6c3a41919","name":"Rask, Anders Bindslev","orcid":"0000-0002-0835-7974","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Elsebeth K.","key":"sorensenpau","last":"Sorensen","name":"Sorensen, Elsebeth K.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Elsebeth Korsgaard","key":"sorensenpedh","last":"Sorensen","name":"Sorensen, Elsebeth Korsgaard","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Andras","key":"szucspedh","last":"Szucs","name":"Szucs, Andras","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Md. Saifuddin","key":"khalidpedh","last":"Khalid","name":"Khalid, Md. Saifuddin","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"eisbn":["9788771124057"],"isbn":["9788771124026"],"pages":"45-48","place":"Aalborg","publisher":"Aalborg Universitetsforlag","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 1st D4 Learning International Conference"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","KP","Universities","University College of Northern Denmark","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["kp-66a89109-00d6-44a5-bc27-b44e46b10ed2","ucn-66a89109-00d6-44a5-bc27-b44e46b10ed2"],"src":["KP University College Copenhagen","UCN University College of Northern Denmark"],"title":"Inclusive E-Learning Practices at University Colleges in Denmark","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-038949","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Evalueringsrapporten gør status på Amager Fælled Skoles udvikling fra skolen blev udpeget til at være sundhedspædagogisk profilskole i løbet af år 2009 til nu, juni 2013. Formålet med evalueringen er, at de indhentede erfaringer skal kunne bruges af Københavns Kommune i det videre arbejde med sundhedsfremme på kom-munens skoler og i kommunens arbejde med andre profilskoler. Endvidere er det formålet, at evalueringen skal kunne bruges i skolens videre arbejde med at frem-me sundhed for skolens elever.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Siiger, Charlotte","Risager, Lis Lak"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-392323"],"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Sundhedspædagogik"],"level":"sci","oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-KP"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"amager fælled skole som sundhedspædagogisk profilskole en evalueringsrapport","src":["kp"],"src-code":["DI-UC-KP"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://ucviden.kp.dk/ws/files/15560179/010713_AFS_eva_rapport_sendt_til_KK_og_AFS_290713.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-392323","ids":["kp-dd2b3913-4045-463c-8604-923a24c9e49e"],"keyword":["sundhedspædagogik"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","noi":["Local-1-1-FE1BA1F2C1D3F2404936002352D18A6B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://ucviden.kp.dk/ws/files/15560179/010713_AFS_eva_rapport_sendt_til_KK_og_AFS_290713.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"kp university college copenhagen","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-KP","l3nl":"KP","l3nn":"KP University College Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KP University College Copenhagen","namevar":["Professionshøjskolen Metropol (ophørt), Institut for Rehabilitering og Ernæring (ophørt), Professionsbachelor i Ernæring og Sundhed (ophørt)"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-KP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte","key":"siigerpau","last":"Siiger","locid":"f5dfa250-e9bd-47cd-bf45-76cc876f1fd5","name":"Siiger, Charlotte","orcid":"0000-0002-6326-1641","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lis Lak","key":"risagerpau","last":"Risager","locid":"500c2707-2248-4ca6-9c30-0c1e554ea8ac","name":"Risager, Lis Lak","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"45","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","KP","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["kp-dd2b3913-4045-463c-8604-923a24c9e49e"],"src":["KP University College Copenhagen"],"title":"Amager Fælled Skole som sundhedspædagogisk profilskole - en evalueringsrapport","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-392323","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
